title: Entering_Town
---
Lona: Huh..?
Driver: Sounds like someone finally woke up. Youv'e been snoring the whole ride.
Driver: Drowin' out my blues music with your noise back there.
Lona: Uhh...
Driver: Nah, don't worry about it kid. We are almost there.
Lona's Thoughts: <i>My dream... Jason. Gosh why is everything so fuzzy.</i>
Lona: I had a dream of playing with Jason, like we did when we were kids.
Lona: Back when he was alive. 
Lona: Before I recieved a letter asking me to come back here.
Lona: A letter from my best friend Jason...
Lona: Who has been missing for five years, and is most likely dead.
Lona: Yet I recieved a letter from him, yet I am here.
Lona: Heading back to WestEnd to find him. 
===
